Error [E0502]: `Float` can't be a map key type (D-MAP-KEY1)
  --> tests/ui/map_key_composite_rejected.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     floats :: [Float:Int]{}
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: map keys must be Int, String, Bool, Char, U8/IntN, a payload-free enum, or a tuple/struct whose fields recursively follow D-MAP-KEY1; Float, views, Shared, functions, lists, maps, sets, and payload-carrying enums are not key-eligible
 Fix: use an eligible scalar, enum, tuple, or struct key; remove non-key fields or store the value separately
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0502

